  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "This, these",
     "texto": [
      "On their own, the forms **ce/cet/cette/ces** do not distinguish «this» from «that»; context makes it clear. If needed, you can add **-ci** (here) or **-là** (there) after the noun: **ce pantalon-ci**, **ce pantalon-là**.",
      "**ce** pantalon (masculine), **cette** robe (feminine), **ces** chaussures (plural).",
      "Before a vowel or a silent h, **ce** becomes **cet**: **cet ordinateur**, **cet hôtel**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Demonstratives",
     "columnas": [
      {
