     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Wearing",
     "texto": [
      "**Porter** means «to wear»: **Je porte une veste** (I'm wearing a jacket). It is a regular -er verb.",
      "Unlike in English, colors agree with the item of clothing: **un manteau noir**, **une veste noire**, **des chaussures noires**. Remember: **blanc** → **blanche**. Those that end in -e don't change in the feminine: **rouge**, **jaune**.",
      "**J'aime bien** = I like (quite a lot). **Je préfère** = I prefer."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
